PRODUCT: Protonabu Package
    ID
        PROPERTY [AUTHOR]: Avner Ben
            BULLET [CREATED]: 06-Oct-2005
                BULLET: Skilltree parser
            BULLET [REVISED]: 1-Apr-2017
                BULLET: Nabu Labeled-fact architecture
            BULLET [IMPROVED]: 24-Aug-2026
                BULLET: Prepared for separation
        PROPERTY [GENERATOR]: Antigravity (Gemini 3.7 Flash)
            BULLET [IMPROVED]: 24-Aug-2026

    USE CASE: to compile <Protonabu> Parser source
        TITLE: Parsing Fact Snippet from Source
        REQUIRES: to INITIALIZE Protonabu Parser
        REQUIRES: to compile <Protonabu> Parser source

    USE CASE: to parse Schema tree
        TITLE: Compiling and Validating Protonabu Syntax Schema
        REQUIRES: to INITIALIZE Protonabu Schema
        REQUIRES: to parse Schema tree

    USE CASE: to parse one Labeled Fact raw elements from Fact stream
        TITLE: Serializing and Deserializing Composite Facts
        REQUIRES: to INITIALIZE Raw Fact
        REQUIRES: to parse one Labeled Fact raw elements from Fact stream
        REQUIRES: to restore Labeled Fact to one or more Fact lines

    USE CASE: to report parse tree
        TITLE: Reporting Protonabu Syntax Schema and Visual EBNF
        REQUIRES: to report parse tree
        REQUIRES: to report Protonabu schema under Label
        REQUIRES: to print graphic EBNF diagram

    USE CASE: to perform Protonabu Parser Test Cases
        TITLE: Performing Protonabu Parser Test Cases
        SCENARIO: Full Protonabu Parser test
        IN SCENARIO [Full Protonabu Parser test]: to INITIALIZE Protonabu Schema Test Case [FOR to INITIALIZE test case]
        REQUIRES: to perform Unit Test
            SCANNING: "test cases"
            REQUIRES: to test Protonabu syntax Schema parsing
            REQUIRES: to test Protonabu tokenizing
            REQUIRES: to test Protonabu parsing of imports
            REQUIRES: to test bad multiple-modifier parsing
            REQUIRES: to test Exit Validators mechanism
            REQUIRES: to test unquoted Italian apostrophe parsing
            REQUIRES: to test error fields and file attribute preservation

    USE CASE: to perform Raw Fact Test Cases
        TITLE: Performing Raw Fact Test Cases
        REQUIRES: to perform Unit Test
            SCANNING: "test cases"
            REQUIRES: to INITIALIZE Raw Fact Test Case
            REQUIRES: to perform Raw Fact test case


